<a href="/tools/" style="background: #c9973a; color: #2d5248; font-weight: 800; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; white-space: nowrap; transition: background 0.2s;">Start Now — $15 →</a>
